  "evidenceSpans": [
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCFIN001-46bdfeab",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN001-0002",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本办法适用于 DEMO-BANK 各级机构办理的流动资金贷款业务，包括流动资金授信、流动资金贷款及其项下的资金支付管理。",
      "quoteHash": "46bdfeab21af8085b568acb17122cc749fe598c880be5da1c9cf888f562c4427",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2a95a8c6f15c0145c06f938259870340187561ab6b6609f2e62aff6a3ae49a56",
      "sourceId": "SRC-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-FIN-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN001-20260922-2a95a8c6",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCFIN001-0424926d",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN001-0004",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本办法所称借款人应为依法登记并存续的法人或非法人组织；按照国家有关规定不得办理银行贷款的主体除外。",
      "quoteHash": "0424926deaad33db1d52347e86abf5c2827dd4c76d8414d8bc6b5d5b605787cb",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2a95a8c6f15c0145c06f938259870340187561ab6b6609f2e62aff6a3ae49a56",
      "sourceId": "SRC-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-FIN-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN001-20260922-2a95a8c6",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCFIN001-e2527e93",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN001-0005",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "借款人应同时满足下列基本条件：一、依法经市场监督管理部门或主管部门核准登记；二、借款用途明确、合法；三、具有持续经营能力与合法还款来源；四、信用状况良好、近十二个月无重大结算违规记录；五、内部评级不低于本办法第六条要求。",
      "quoteHash": "e2527e938432632f248730796bbd40ed5f8706f89af686ec553c8d55fd693bb1",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2a95a8c6f15c0145c06f938259870340187561ab6b6609f2e62aff6a3ae49a56",
      "sourceId": "SRC-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-FIN-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN001-20260922-2a95a8c6",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCFIN001-99d99ca7",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN001-0006",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "内部评级与受理档位：AA 级及以上可受理全部流动资金贷款品种；BB 级至 A 级可受理标准流动资金贷款；B 级至 BB 级以下须经一级分行交易银行部与风险管理部双签方可受理。",
      "quoteHash": "99d99ca77503eda9594c5ba8ddc44df06ebfa0abfda56e9c929ce11111c628ca",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2a95a8c6f15c0145c06f938259870340187561ab6b6609f2e62aff6a3ae49a56",
      "sourceId": "SRC-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-FIN-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN001-20260922-2a95a8c6",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCFIN001-5651b3c9",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN001-0011",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "贷款利率按照本行定价管理有关规定确定，并在借款合同中明确约定；涉及利率调整的，应当约定调整条件与生效方式。",
      "quoteHash": "5651b3c986552aa248ca633f1178b0afc2ad1649237da70adae16b26b9eb5992",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2a95a8c6f15c0145c06f938259870340187561ab6b6609f2e62aff6a3ae49a56",
      "sourceId": "SRC-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-FIN-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN001-20260922-2a95a8c6",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "RISK",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCFIN001-2255007e",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN001-0012",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "受理环节应收集：营业执照或组织文件、章程、股东与实际控制人信息、近两年经审计财务报表、纳税与结算流水、借款用途相关交易背景材料。",
      "quoteHash": "2255007e11783b98b18f47ba524a64ddd5919bb35a72ba43b60634f91f8b00c5",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2a95a8c6f15c0145c06f938259870340187561ab6b6609f2e62aff6a3ae49a56",
      "sourceId": "SRC-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-FIN-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN001-20260922-2a95a8c6",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCFIN001-9d467d29",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN001-0013",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "尽职调查应采取现场与非现场相结合方式，并形成书面报告；对符合条件的小微企业借款人，可通过非现场手段有效核实信息真实性的，可简化或不再进行现场调查，具体金额上限由一级分行审慎确定。",
      "quoteHash": "9d467d293bbbd2c5f2571aec2058fec03e6bc81c3704f769d7856957ae8ad792",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2a95a8c6f15c0145c06f938259870340187561ab6b6609f2e62aff6a3ae49a56",
      "sourceId": "SRC-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-FIN-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN001-20260922-2a95a8c6",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCFIN001-7127df9b",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN001-0014",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "审批应坚持\"贷审分离、分级审批\"：审批人员应在授权范围内按流程审批，**不得越权审批**；为股东等关联方办理的，条件不得优于一般借款人，并在风险评价报告中说明。",
      "quoteHash": "7127df9b21c01fb2c10486e0d7068c22f7f99fe0f8019aa99b30a70f7ca4b416",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2a95a8c6f15c0145c06f938259870340187561ab6b6609f2e62aff6a3ae49a56",
      "sourceId": "SRC-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-FIN-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN001-20260922-2a95a8c6",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCFIN001-bb4d2e7c",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN001-0015",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "发放前应确认借款人满足合同约定的提款条件；贷款资金支付分为**受托支付**与**自主支付**两种方式。",
      "quoteHash": "bb4d2e7ce945324a63c8a69ba344c8d156c0e4e479f1d9b5d2700f53e7d8225b",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2a95a8c6f15c0145c06f938259870340187561ab6b6609f2e62aff6a3ae49a56",
      "sourceId": "SRC-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-FIN-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN001-20260922-2a95a8c6",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "RISK",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCFIN001-de7e5136",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN001-0018",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "贷后管理应至少包括：资金挪用监控、指定资金回笼账户管理、预警信号跟踪与处置、贷款风险分类复核。发现挪用的，按合同约定要求整改、提前收回或下调风险分类。",
      "quoteHash": "de7e51369e967e4d894111dc010f641e5fee46ba732a819c0440f98e724a9fda",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "2a95a8c6f15c0145c06f938259870340187561ab6b6609f2e62aff6a3ae49a56",
      "sourceId": "SRC-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-FIN-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN001-20260922-2a95a8c6",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "RISK",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCFIN001-39a299e6",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN001-0019",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十九条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "借款人申请展期的，应审慎评估展期原因与后续还款安排；同意展期的，合理确定展期期限并按实质风险状况进行风险分类。",
      "quoteHash": "39a299e6a3490a76055e2fc9e852420df323071564c99b678bef75dc558be43c",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
